From b778a44ef703407646fe44515e01982378784b84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: emergent-agent-e1 <github@emergent.sh>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 06:41:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(fmc130): confirm PRIVATE/BUSINESS via hardware-command
 ACK (fail-closed)

Root cause: Teltonika replies 'Privatemode ON/OFF' (Air Console) but backend stayed
PENDING->UNKNOWN. Per Navixy history schema, HARDWARE (raw) commands carry
extra.command.response.success ONLY (body null); only HTTP commands carry body.

Matcher (_command_response_matches), FAIL-CLOSED strict:
- TEXT path uses ONLY response.body / extra.full_message / entry.message (NOT cmd.name/param).
- HARDWARE-ACK path uses cmd.name+param and requires response.success is True (never None)
  + no explicit error; strict normalized match of privatemode on/off | privatemode:1/0.
- Explicit failure (success False / error) => never confirmed. Anti-stale unchanged.

+12 tests. Confirmation 28/28, full regression 142/142 PASS. DEVICE_WRITE stays 0; no
device command (all mocked). Adds READ-ONLY diagnostic navixy_device_response_diag_781479.py.
